SKILL.md is byte-for-byte the upstream file at that commit; do not edit it
here. Installed by copying the file, not by `npx skills add`, so no
upstream code runs at session start.

The skill tells the assistant to run `npx skills find` / `npx skills add`,
which download and execute the skills CLI. Searching works without it:
  curl -sS "https://skills.sh/api/search?q=<query>&limit=10"

To bump: read the new upstream SKILL.md in full first (it is instructions
the assistant follows), then replace SKILL.md and update commit above.
